{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p000747","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p000747"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p000747","label":"周生（太史公所引）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"周生","mention_ids":["c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m045-0008"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m045-0008","chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p045","quote":"周生"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m045-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"周生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000747","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p045","chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p045","text":"太史公曰：吾聞之周生曰：「舜目蓋重瞳子」，又聞項羽亦重瞳子。羽豈其苗裔邪？何興之暴也？夫秦失其政，陳涉首難，豪傑蠭起，相與并爭，不可勝數。然羽非有尺寸，乘勢起隴畝之中，三年，遂將五諸侯滅秦，分裂天下而封王侯，政由羽出，號為霸王，位雖不終，近古以來未嘗有也。及羽背關懷楚，放逐義帝而自立，怨王侯叛己，難矣。自矜功伐，奮其私智而不師古，謂霸王之業，欲以力征經營天下，五年，卒亡其國，身死東城，尚不覺寤，而不自責，過矣。乃引「天亡我，非用兵之罪也」，豈不謬哉！","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m045-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"太史公","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"論贊署稱保留，尚待作者層次與身份覆核，不由稱謂補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m045-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"周生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000747","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m045-0013","start":13,"end":14,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000030","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m045-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m045-0030","start":30,"end":31,"surface":"羽","kind":"person","person_id":"c